WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:07.701
Systems as a production manager. One crew list, and every form fills in from it.

2
00:00:07.951 --> 00:00:14.903
Start with the crew list. Each person's status, rate and paperwork is on one line.

3
00:00:15.153 --> 00:00:21.704
Start packs by status. PAYE, loan-out and self-employed crew each get the right pack.

4
00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:27.305
The borough permit clock counts down each council's own lead time.

5
00:00:27.555 --> 00:00:32.905
And every permit deadline goes into your calendar in one tap.

6
00:00:33.156 --> 00:00:39.307
The float register shows who signed for which float, and what's still out.

7
00:00:39.557 --> 00:00:49.307
When the schedule moves, make the next call sheet version and send it by WhatsApp or email.

